From 63fe4545d489743190845c750b0547a945cc1ae1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@local>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:33:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] ios: add bins/ios staticlib crate (concord_start, iOS
 platform, socketpair bridge)

Mirrors bins/android as libconcord_ios.a (crate-type staticlib+rlib):
concord_start() with no thread hook, Core with EngineConfig
{ android: false } and capabilities [tun.inherited, tun.channel], an
IosPlatform with no host callbacks (protect is a no-op true, find_owner
is None), a SOCK_DGRAM socketpair bridge (Option A), and a hand-written
concord_ios.h. Full upstream workspace, no feature trimming.

Rebased onto 5f1d090: Hub::new now takes (handle, server) only, the
Server owns the Control, so core.rs drops the third argument.
